<title>LEBANON: Israeli soldier killed in south Lebanon clashes.</title>
<headline>Israeli soldier killed in south Lebanon clashes.</headline>
<dateline>MARJAYOUN, Lebanon 1997-07-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>An Israeli soldier was fatally wounded in fighting with Hizbollah guerrillas in south Lebanon on Sunday, pro-Israeli militia sources said.</p>
<p>The soldier was wounded in Sojoud area on the edge of Israel's south Lebanon occupation zone in a day of heavy clashes with the pro-Iranian guerrillas. The soldier later died of his wounds, the sources said.</p>
</text>
